WEBVTT

2
00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:24.400
Pure, Chile, is your bluish sky

3
00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:28.650
pure breezes cross you as well

4
00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:33.140
and your flower-embroidered fields

5
00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:37.380
are the happy copy of Eden

6
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:42.000
Majestic are the white mountains

7
00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:46.630
that the Lord gave you as a bastion,

8
00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:51.000
that the Lord gave you as a bastion

9
00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:55.430
And the sea that tranquilly bathes you

10
00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:59.190
promises you a future splendor

11
00:00:59.210 --> 00:01:03.560
And the sea that tranquilly bathes you

12
00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:07.320
promises you a future splendor.

13
00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:18.170
Sweet fatherland, receive the vows

14
00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:26.590
that Chile gave you on your altars

15
00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:31.150
That you be either the tomb of the free

16
00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:38.330
or a refuge against oppression

17
00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:40.070
That you be either the tomb of the free

18
00:01:40.090 --> 00:01:43.390
or a refuge against oppression

19
00:01:43.410 --> 00:01:48.830
That you be either the tomb of the free

20
00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:53.620
or a refuge against oppression

21
00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:57.870
or a refuge against oppression

22
00:01:57.890 --> 00:02:01.010
or a refuge against oppression.
